BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 552.47 Td (1. Print on plain printer paper, not card. Cut along the dashed lines.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 542.55 Td (2. Write your phone number on the strip. Scan the code, or visit straycats.love/c, to learn more.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 532.63 Td (    If the cat is in the StrayCats app, write its ID on the strip.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 522.71 Td (3. Only for a friendly cat you can handle easily. Never a nervous or feral cat, and not for kittens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 512.79 Td (4. Wrap it loosely around the neck: two fingers should slide under it easily.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 502.87 Td (5. Overlap the ends and tape them together with one small piece of tape, paper to paper. Never tape the whole collar: plain paper tears if the collar) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 492.94 Td (    snags, but tape stops it tearing. No tape on fur.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0 g 28.35 483.02 Td (6. Check on the cat, and take the collar off if it bothers them.) Tj ET
